CTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="description" content="Explore world-class travel destinations, from the historic Colosseum to the serene Alps.">
    <title>Travel Agency Page</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Global Explorations</h1>
        <p>Embark on the journey of a lifetime. From historic ruins to serene coastlines, your next adventure starts here.</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section>
            <h2>Packages</h2>
            <p>Choose the travel style that fits your rhythm.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="https://www.freecodecamp.org/learn" target="_blank">Group Travels</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.freecodecamp.org/learn" target="_blank">Private Tours</a></li>
            </ul>
            <!-- Test Fix: h2 element immediately after the unordered list -->
            <h2>Top Itineraries</h2>
        </section>

        <section>
            <figure>
                <a href="https://www.freecodecamp.org/learn" target="_blank">
                    <img src="https://freecodecamp.org" alt="The Colosseum in Rome">
                </a>
                <figcaption>Experience the ancient grandeur of Rome.</figcaption>
            </figure>

            <figure>
                <a href="https://www.freecodecamp.org/learn" target="_blank">
                    <img src="https://freecodecamp.org" alt="Snow-capped Alps">
                </a>
                <figcaption>Breathe in the crisp air of the Alpine peaks.</figcaption>
            </figure>

            <figure>
                <a href="https://www.freecodecamp.org/learn" target="_blank">
                    <img src="https://freecodecamp.org" alt="Tropical beach">
                </a>
                <figcaption>Relax by the tranquil turquoise waters.</figcaption>
            </figure>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>

